Z||000000||Bill 88||02-06-2001||05:22 PM||||I have an open between the manaul neutral switch and the starter.  Can you tell me where the connectors might be that would cause this?  ( I know this because I have power(12v)through the switch but none(0v) at the starter||||reg||1
Z||000001||Indiana_resto_guy||02-06-2001||08:21 PM||||Have you checked the switch operation? May be just out of adjustment.||||reg||1
Z||000002||Bill 88||02-07-2001||09:55 AM|||| I have taken the wires off the neutral switch and jumpered them and I have watched the test light that I have hooked up.  The light will come on at the connector when I turn the ignition switch. But there is nothing at the starter(no light, no voltage).  I am assuming that there is a connector between the neutral switch and the starter. I mean under the dash or console, going out the firewall.  I am a little slow with this (my wife lets me work on it one hour a week, she says that should be enough time for any one with half a brain. she could be right, after all, she does have half a brain). ||||reg||1
Z||000003||Indiana_resto_guy||02-07-2001||10:20 AM||||There should be a fuse link at the starter solonid, where you must be checking voltage. check it and make sure it is good. There are 2 ways to check it, 1 is to jumper the switch and turn key, check for voltage BEFORE splice. 2nd is to disconnect wire at solonid and check resistance (ohms) for the link from connector to above splice.||||reg||1
Z||000004||Bill 88||02-07-2001||11:12 AM||||I have the wire from the battery to the starter( 4 gauge or whatever it is - big) and a purple wire going to the small bolt.  It uses a 3/8 or 5/16 wrench.  are their more wires?  This is a 88 fiero with a 2.5l 4 cylinder. ||||reg||1
Z||000005||polomeno||02-07-2001||12:45 PM||||I have a 2.5 on an 84 and there are 3 wires going to starter.. not 2... not sure if it's the same for you.. ||||reg||1
Z||000006||Bill 88||03-16-2001||09:56 AM|||| Found it.  Bad, broken, shody connection at the connector block near the battery.  Thanks for the help||||reg||1
